VLAN Mapping
In config.yaml, define port ranges:

yaml
vlan_mapping:
  "1-20": 10
  "21-36": 20
  "37-48": 30



Uplink Ports
Default uplink ports: 47, 48, 49, 50. You can change in snmp_utils.py.




